  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.5 (2026-10-08)\n\n - CCCPL001 flags a parameter list that spans more than one line while one of those lines still starts more than one parameter.\n - Methods, local functions, constructors, and primary constructors of classes, structs, and records are in scope.\n - Default severity is warning. Set ParameterListLayoutAnalyzerSeverity to warning, error, message, or off.\n\n0.1 (2026-10-07)\n\n - Initial release.\n - CCCRC001 flags a return expression whose calculation-step score exceeds ReturnTypeComplexityAnalyzerMaximum (default 1).\n - String concatenation and nameof do not count. One arithmetic operator, one method call, or one conditional is allowed at the default.\n - Default severity is warning; set warning, error, message, or off.",
